hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"631","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab etikaf ka irada kartay to Fajr ki namaz padh kar etikaf ki jagah mein daakhil ho jatay. Aur aik baar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne masjid mein apna khema laganay ka hukm farmaya. Wo laga diya gaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ramazan ke ashra-e-aakhir mein etikaf ka irada kiya tha to Zainab (raziyallahu anha) ne apne liye khema laganay ka kaha to un ke liye bhi khema laga diya gaya. Phir doosri Ummahaat-ul-Momineen ne kaha to un ke khemay bhi laga diye gaye. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fajr ki namaz padh chukay to sab khemayon ko dekha aur farmaya ke in logon ne kya neki ka irada kiya hai? Is mein riya ki boo paayi jati hai. Chunanche Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna khema kholnay ka hukm diya to usay khol diya gaya aur Aap ne Ramazan mein etikaf tark kar diya yahan tak ke phir Shawwal ke pehlay ashray mein etikaf kiya. (Muslim: 3/175). Baab: Pehlay ashray aur darmiyani ashray ka etikaf."
"632","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, bayan kartay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ramazan ke pehlay ashray mein etikaf kiya phir darmiyani ashray mein aik Turki khemay mein ke jis ke darwazay par chaatai latki hui thi, etikaf kiya. Teesray ashray ke shuru mein Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) bayan kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne dast-e-mubarak se chaatai ko pakar kar khemay ke aik konay mein kar diya aur apna sar bahar nikaal kar logon se mukhatib hue to log Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke qareeb ho gaye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne raat, Laila-tul-Qadr, ki talash mein pehlay ashray mein etikaf kiya, phir darmiyani ashray mein etikaf kiya, phir mere paas koi farishta aaya aur meri taraf ye wahi ki gayi ke Laila-tul-Qadr ki ye raat aakhri ashray mein hai. Tum mein se jo shakhs etikaf karna chahay to wo etikaf karay. Chunanche logon ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath etikaf kiya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mujhe dikhaya gaya ke wo taaq raaton mein hai aur main us ki subah ko pani aur mitti mein sajda kar raha hun. Phir jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ikkiswin shab ki subah hui aur us raat Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) subah tak namaz padhtay rahay. Aur barish hui to masjid tapki aur main ne mitti aur pani ko dekha. Phir jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) subah ki namaz padh kar niklay to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki peshani aur naak ki choti par mitti aur pani ka nishan tha aur wo aakhri ashra Ramazan ki ikkiswin raat thi. (Muslim). (Suddah se murad darwaza hai; wokf se murad tapakna hai.)"
"633","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamesha Ramazan ke aakhri ashray mein etikaf farmatay thay yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wafaat paayi. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj-e-mutahharat (raziyallahu anhunna) ne etikaf kiya. (Muslim: 3/175). Baab: Aakhri ashray mein mehnat."
"634","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aadat mubarak thi ke jab Ramazan ka aakhri ashra aata to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) raat bhar jagtay aur ghar walon ko bhi jagatay, ibadat mein nihayat koshish kartay aur kamar, himmat baandh letay thay. (Muslim: 3/176). Baab: Laila-tul-Qadr aur usay aakhri ashray mein talash karnay ke baaray mein. (Ahya se murad ghalib taur par jagna hai; mizar baandhnay se murad ibadat ke liye auraton se alag hona hai.)"
"635","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shab-e-qadr ko Ramazan ke aakhri ashray mein dhoondo phir agar koi kamzori dikhaye ya aajiz ho jaye to aakhir ki saat raaton mein sust na ho. (Muslim: 3/170). Baab: Laila-tul-Qadr ikkiswin raat hai; Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees is mein guzar chuki hai, number 632."
"636","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Unais (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe Shab-e-qadr dikhayi gayi thi phir bhula di gayi. Aur main ne khwab mein dekha ke us raat ki subah ko main pani aur keechar mein sajda kar raha hun. Rawi ne kaha ke ham par tayeeswin shab ko barish barsi aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein namaz padhayi. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz padh kar phiray, yani subah ki, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki peshani aur naak par pani aur keechar ka asar tha. Aur Abdullah bin Unais (raziyallahu anhu) tayeeswin raat ko Shab-e-qadr kaha kartay thay. (Muslim: 3/173). Baab: Usay nawin, saatwin aur panchwin mein talash karo."
"637","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, bayan kartay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ramazan ke darmiyani ashray mein etikaf kiya, jis mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Laila-tul-Qadr ka ilm diye janay se qabal usay dhoondtay thay. Jab darmiyani ashra guzar gaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khema kholnay ka hukm diya to wo khol diya gaya. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko maloom karwa diya gaya ke ye aakhri ashray mein hai to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khema laganay ka hukm kiya to dobara laga diya gaya. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sahaba ke paas aaye to farmaya: Ae logon! Mujhe Laila-tul-Qadr ka ilm de diya gaya tha aur main tumhein batany ke liye nikla tha ke do aadmi lartay hue aaye jin ke saath shaitaan bhi tha, to us ki tayeen mujhe bhula di gayi. Ab tum usay Ramazan ke aakhri ashray mein talash karo, aakhri ashray ki nawin, saatwin aur panchwin raat mein talash karo. Rawi kehtay hain ke main ne Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke is adad ke baaray mein tum ham se zyada ilm rakhtay ho to unhon ne kaha ke haan! Ham is ke tum se zyada haqdaar hain. Rawi kehtay hain, main ne kaha ke nawin, saatwin aur panchwin se kaun si raatein murad hain? Unhon ne kaha ke jab ikkiswin raat guzar jaye ke jis ke baad baayeeswin raat aati hai, yehi nawin se murad hai. Aur jab tayeeswin guzar jaye to us ke baad wali aati hai, yehi saatwin se murad hai aur jab pacheeswin raat guzar jaye to jo us ke baad wali hai, yehi murad hai panchwin se. (Muslim)."
"638","[AI-translation] Zirr bin Hubaish (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha ke tumharay bhai Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke jo saal bhar tak jaagay ga, us ko Shab-e-qadr milay gi to unhon ne kaha ke Allah Taala un par rehem farmaye, ye kehnay se un ki gharz ye thi ke log aik hi raat par bharosa na kar baithein balke hamesha ibadat mein mashghool rahein warna wo khoob jantay thay ke wo Ramazan mein, aakhri ashray mein hai aur wo sattaeeswin raat hai. Phir unhon ne baghair inshaAllah kahay qasam utha kar kaha ke wo sattaeeswin raat hai. Main ne un se kaha ke Ae Abu Munzir! Tum ye daawa kis bina par kartay ho? Unhon ne kaha ke aik nishani ya alamat ki wajah se jis ki khabar hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne di hai, wo ye ke us ki subah ko aaftab jo nikalta hai to us mein shua nahi hoti, magar ye alamat us raat ke khatm honay ke baad zaahir hoti hai. (Muslim: 3/174). (Asal mein wabil aaya thi, Muslim se tasheeh hai; shu'a se murad sooraj hai.)"
